caption: Source Pay Schedule

Now, you are probably wondering “How much can I get paid for risking my life, and when do I get to shoot fascists?” We are too! G ranked missions have a base pay of ₴980, with up to ₴420 earnable through client satisfaction rating! Remember, any damage to public, client, or Starbucks property is taken out of your final mission pay, so don’t break anything you aren’t supposed to! This goes up to a base pay of ₴2,450 at F rank and ₴4,900 at E rank; they’re raking in the big bucks! It is important to note that all mission payouts are per mission, not per person, so if you can get the job done with fewer people, the more money you make! Starbucks recommends 5 person teams and taking only one mission per week, but we won’t hold you to that: if you want to make the big bucks, go as hard as you want! What about unexpected hazards? That’s what we live for here at Starbucks! Unexpected complications that cause danger to the mission or Starbucks contractors qualify you for Hazard Pay, which can be up to double the base pay. To rake in the money, you really need to take those dangerous jobs! (it is important to note that bonus hazard pay is only for unexpected hazards; expected hazards are calculated into base mission Rank)
